WEBVTT

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
Run at once towards a dream

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
yume no mukou e ikkini hashitte yo

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.780
Let’s meet and laugh away yesterday’s troubles

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.780
nayameru kinou wo fungiri warai aou

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
When our memories were here,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
omoide ga itta no toki mo

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
even though we are deeply hurt, go straight on

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
kizu wo fukai no ni massugu mae ni

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.610
GO TO NEW WORLD

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:54.470
I can feel it in the wind

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:54.470
kaze no naka kanjiteru yo

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
The hot beat is shining

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
atsui kodou kagayaku yo

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
especially now…

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
ima koso

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
surely, always, you’ll be by my side

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
kitto zutto soba ni iru yo ne

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
Keep on running the way to the future.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
mirai no michi wo hashiri tsuzukeyou

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
more and more, no matter what happens

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
motto motto nani ga okitemo

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
half our tears become double smiles

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
namida wa hanbun nibai no egao ni naru

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
forever

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
itsudemo

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:40.000
Sensei, thanks to you,

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:44.230
we could labor for the prosperity of our relationship.

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:45.250
What do you think?

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:58.600
Well… it’s fine.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:02.400
Thank you very much.

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:44.130
So?

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.080
I told you, I’m not selling.

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.080
Now?

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:53.980
My family has been working in this rice cracker store since my grandfather’s time.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:56.980
No matter how much you pile up, I’m not leaving it.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.700
There, there, there, there, there,

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:00.530
THERE!

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:06.900
Stop right there!

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:15.050
Gothiloli Mask is here!

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.140
What the crap?!

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:19.830
Stop taking people’s property!

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.340
Nobody likes people like you!

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.130
Yeah, that’s right! He was causing me trouble.

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:30.270
Hurry up and disappear!

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.180
Dammit!

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:38.240
You interfered when I was just one step away.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.530
Wonton! Get ’em!

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:51.290
Cycling, cycling, yahoo, yahoo…

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:25.740
Wow!

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.380
Whitey! Do get ’em!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.880
Bear! Bear! Bear! Bear! Bear! Bear!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.680
Argh, this can’t be!

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.270
I should just give up.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:19.980
Say, old lady…

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.480
This here…

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.880
Put your seal right here, okay?

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.560
See? Right here.

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:29.810
Yes, yes.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.610
There it is, there…

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:36.930
Yep, just hurry up and put it there…

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.980
Argh, you again?!

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:46.160
Always getting in my way!

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:52.460
Whitey! Go!

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:57.230
Damn you! What are you doing!

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.530
You big piece of…

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:06.100
I-It hurts…

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.380
It hurts…

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.380
If it’s come to this, I’ll have to use force then!

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.780
Good afternoon! I am Niko!

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:41.030
I am Tamago!

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:52.310
There’s 560 days until Nicopaku!

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:52.310
Note: Nicopaku is an abbreviation for the Nikotama Exposition.

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:55.270
So you haven’t made any progress at all?!

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:57.980
The great “Land Shark Joe” is useless!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.030
Geez!

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:01.420
Even though we went to the trouble of calling you in from Kansai!

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.280
Old man…

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:08.530
There were these two Gothiloli Mask brats that have been getting in my way all the time.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.040
It’s not my fault.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:12.080
In other words,

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:16.080
you’re saying that if we annihilate Gothiloli Mask,

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.040
the land speculation business will be fine?

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:20.180
Yeah, that’s it.

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:23.430
Wakagashira. Go gather a few men.

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:24.080
The wakagashira is yakuza slang for the second-in-command under the boss.

00:07:23.430 --> 00:07:24.080
Okay!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:32.130
This has become a big deal, huh?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:32.930
Yeah.

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:42.530
Did’ja hear me, y’all?

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:44.450
Go and bring back their heads!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.820
Right! Right! Right! Right! Right!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.030
Who the hell is it?!

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:00.040
A detective.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.530
You again!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.760
Hey! Is that you, Nidaime?

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:10.260
It seems you’ve got a bit of trouble.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:13.470
If you’re searching for someone, maybe it should be the detective’s turn…

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.230
Just kidding!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:21.280
“Leave mochi making to the mochi makers,” right?

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:21.930
Mochi are Japanese sticky rice cakes. They’re not easy to make.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:23.940
Let’s try and leave it to you.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.820
Thank you very much.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:29.530
Hey! Don’t start slacking off!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.990
Go after those guys right now!

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.130
A’ight!

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:32.530
Okay!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.230
Let’s go!

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:39.080
This will be 15,000 yen per day,

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.430
plus needed expenses.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:02.030
As expected around Nicopaku,

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:03.780
there’s a huge amount of money circulating.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.380
Yeah.

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:09.930
Travellers and banks all have to attend their own business after all.

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:14.030
For our sort of business, this would be a good example.

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.330
If we show them our real face,

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.780
it would be good, wouldn’t it?

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.030
Hey, come on, that was just a joke.

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:24.380
Japan would be thrown into chaos.

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:52.530
Hey, hey! Can ya open the door?

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:57.830
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey…!!

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:02.210
Here comes Gothiloli Mask!

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:04.250
Ah! They’ve appeared!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:33.730
Err… Where are they?

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.130
Where did they hide?

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.380
Ah!

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.160
Young Misses…

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.230
What on earth happened?

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:44.780
Well, that…

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:45.870
is just minor business.

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:49.420
You shouldn’t bother the honest, respectable people.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:50.580
Yes.

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:00.930
Gothiloli Mask?

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:27.580
Koala!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:31.080
I’m Sara.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.000
I’m Soujyu.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.330
I’m Kira.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.010
I’m Yura.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:36.530
Cute…

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:37.980
It’s full of…

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:39.080
What…

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.300
Ahem.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:44.630
It’s like…

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.430
Yeah, yeah, yeah…

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.630
What, what, what?

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:49.930
A proposition?

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:53.230
Addressing me without the proper greeting is unforgivable.

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.430
Eh, that’s absurd, Mr. Hariyama.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:12:00.180
Well, I was just wondering if we could have tea together or something like that.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:00.830
Right?

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:01.240
Y-Yeah!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:08.530
By the way, how did you find out that we were Gothiloli Mask?

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.580
Hmm… About that…

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:12.830
Firstly,

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:17.330
for Gothiloli Mask to appear
wherever that land shark was,

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:21.080
I thought “they sure are very well-informed about the mob’s internal affairs.”

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:27.140
Furthermore, who has a stature corresponding to Gothiloli Mask in that mafia boss’s house…?

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:43.230
In short, I rationally thought it could be no one else but you.

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:45.980
Huh?

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:47.980
Does that mean… I’m mistaken?

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:49.280
That’s impressive.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.780
We are indeed Gothiloli Mask.

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:54.030
Thank goodness!

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.380
I was right! I was correct!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.890
But, why are you interfering with your father’s work?

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:02.980
That is…

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:08.730
Up until recently,
our father has always been

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:10.850
a good boss who takes care of things in his territory.

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:13.630
Boss! I’ll leave it up to you.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.180
Now, now, now…

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:18.480
Get lost!

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:23.630
But from the moment he got involved with Nicopaku,

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:25.080
he has only cared about momey.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:29.280
He called in those lowbred
Kansai land sharks,

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:32.230
and they started bothering the people in the territory.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:36.480
And so, we…

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:39.120
also wanted our father
to return to his old self;

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:41.760
to the boss who was loved by the people of this area.

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:46.470
So, in order to interfere with the land speculation, you became Gothiloli Mask.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:51.310
We want the Yakuza to become respectable again.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.630
There’s no way the Yakuza could be respectable…

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:55.690
Ouch-ouch-ouch…

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.610
You’re going to report this to our father, aren’t you?

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:02.930
Well…

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:04.830
Rentarou.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.830
No. I won’t report it.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:11.780
What?

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:14.670
We’ll cooperate with you.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.000
What?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.180
R-Rentarou!

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:23.580
But,

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:26.830
even if you are getting in the way of those uncool land speculator guys,

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.430
that won’t solve the problem!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:30.380
Yeah.

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:36.430
Is there a simple way to solve the problem?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.200
There is!

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.480
I see.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:50.780
The account book, right?

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:53.880
If we steal that and expose it to the public,

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:57.130
we think father will withdraw from his involvement with Nicopaku.

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:01.030
You think about harsh things.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:03.280
Really?

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:04.930
Here, here, here!

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.280
The thing is in the safe.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.640
How are you going to steal it?

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:10.640
We were thinking of using this.

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:13.280
What is that?

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:14.830
That’s C4.

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:16.930
C4?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.130
It’s a plastic explosive.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.330
What?

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:22.100
We have these too.

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:24.430
A Tokarev?

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:28.380
No, it’s a Makarov.

00:15:29.230 --> 00:15:32.030
Y-You have that sort of stuff at your house?

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:34.080
Yes, we’ll blow it up.

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.930
What? Is this unusual?

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.120
Not at all!

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:08.950
What?

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:13.330
YOU!

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:24.780
It’s Gothiloli!

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:39.640
Cr-Cr-Cr-Crap!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.570
Waaah!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.160
Don’t think you’ll get away, you brats!

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.280
This is real bad!

00:17:00.280 --> 00:17:02.230
If we get caught, we’re gonna get pulverized!

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:03.380
What? Pulverized?!

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:08.180
Yeah?

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:09.680
They’re here!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.180
Huh? But here…

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:13.330
Fool!

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:15.080
It’s not ‘HUH’, <i>you moron!</i>

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:17.210
Just get over here!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:17.850
Hey!

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:18.680
Let’s go!

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:20.930
QUICK!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.270
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:23.930
Oh well.

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.130
They’ve totally found out.

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:41.250
Detective! Catch them!

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:51.430
You stupid idiot!

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:54.880
Don’t mess with me!

00:18:01.280 --> 00:18:01.780
There!

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:09.380
Outta my way!

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.280
I have it!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:28.210
NO! What the heck is this!!

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:30.480
Is this me?

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:31.580
IS THIS ME?!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.330
Well then…

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.320
What will we do with this account book?

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:57.630
What will we do?

00:18:58.230 --> 00:19:01.330
Maybe we should give it to a newspaper company.

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:04.330
It’ll probably be a big scoop.

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:07.740
We also could send it to the Tokyo District Public Prosecutor’s Office.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:11.100
But that could become a huge case.

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.290
We can’t do something like that after all!

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:23.430
We’re sorry!

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:40.730
Huh?

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:42.780
What?

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:49.580
We’re sorry,

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:51.180
Father.

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:54.120
We were Gothiloli Mask.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:06.380
We just wanted you to return to being the
kind boss who takes good care of his people.

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:08.950
That’s why we did all of this.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.630
I see, I see…

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:17.730
You two,

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:22.480
really thought about it that much…

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:26.180
I am to blame.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:28.730
Father!

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:31.380
It’s all right.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.730
It’s all right.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.530
I’m glad.

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:37.830
Yes.

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:41.330
Well then, shall we go?

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:54.780
As expected, Tokyo’s specialties are excellent.

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:56.930
Three boxes please.

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:07.230
The Nicopaku is the best!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.350
The Nicopaku is the best!

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:25.800
We are here.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:25.630
bokura wa koko ni iru

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:33.200
We will be here.

00:22:26.130 --> 00:22:33.200
bokura ga koko ni aru

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:38.520
The slow time is

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:38.520
yuruyaka na jikan ga

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:45.450
flowing in this room.

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:45.450
nagareteru kono heya de

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:49.050
Even if the summer days vanish,

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:49.050
natsu no hi ga kiete mo

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:53.110
the smiles that remain

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:53.110
nokoru egao tachi

00:22:53.230 --> 00:22:59.990
are a chain of happiness up to this point.

00:22:53.230 --> 00:22:59.990
kocchi made shiawase no rensa

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:05.830
Ah, the meaning of honesty,

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:05.830
aa sunaosa no imi

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:14.170
is within the innermost depths of your heart.

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:14.170
KOKORO no zutto zutto oku no hou e

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:19.550
Hey, the days are wonderful

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:19.550
nee subarashii hibi

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:27.310
in the midst of weakness and anxiety.

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:27.310
yowasa to fuan no naka de shitte

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:33.860
I won’t say goodbye, Because forever

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:33.860
sayonara wa iwanai yo datte itsumademo

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:39.140
the days will be unchanged.

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:39.140
kawaru koto no nai hibi

00:23:39.330 --> 00:23:45.980
Surely forever. M

00:23:39.330 --> 00:23:45.980
kitto itsumademo

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:55.900
Next Episode Preview

